{{if .plugins.lakebase -}}
Feature: Todo list
  A visitor keeps a short list of things to do, saved in Lakebase.

  Scenario: A visitor with nothing to do is invited to add something
    Given a visitor
    And the todo list is empty
    When they open the todo list
    Then they are invited to add a todo
    And the page has no accessibility violations

  Scenario: A visitor sees what is done and what is left
    Given a visitor
    And the todo list holds:
      | title        | done |
      | Buy milk     | no   |
      | Walk the dog | yes  |
    When they open the todo list
    Then they see the todos "Buy milk" and "Walk the dog"
    And the list says "1 of 2 completed"
    And the page has no accessibility violations

  Scenario: A visitor adds a todo
    Given a visitor
    And the todo list is empty
    When they open the todo list
    And they add the todo "Feed the cat"
    Then they see the todo "Feed the cat"
    And the list says "0 of 1 completed"

  Scenario: A visitor is told while a todo is being saved
    Given a visitor
    And the todo list is empty and saving a todo takes a moment
    When they open the todo list
    And they add the todo "Water the plants"
    Then they are told the todo is being added
    And they see the todo "Water the plants"

  Scenario: A visitor finishes a todo and takes it back
    Given a visitor
    And the todo list holds:
      | title    | done |
      | Buy milk | no   |
    When they open the todo list
    And they mark "Buy milk" as complete
    Then the list says "1 of 1 completed"
    When they mark "Buy milk" as incomplete
    Then the list says "0 of 1 completed"

  Scenario: A visitor removes a todo
    Given a visitor
    And the todo list holds:
      | title        | done |
      | Buy milk     | no   |
      | Walk the dog | no   |
    When they open the todo list
    And they delete "Buy milk"
    Then they no longer see the todo "Buy milk"
    And they see the todo "Walk the dog"
    And the list says "0 of 1 completed"

  Scenario: A visitor is told when the todo list cannot be loaded
    Given a visitor
    And the todo service is down
    When they open the todo list
    Then they are told the page failed to load because "Failed to fetch todos: Internal Server Error"
{{- end}}
